# Sofacy Trojan Loader Activity | T1059.003, T1218.011 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/APT28/proc_creation_win_apt_sofacy.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\rundll32.exe" (CommandLine IN ("*%LOCALAPPDATA%*", "*\\AppData\\Local\\*")) (CommandLine="*.dat\",*" OR CommandLine IN ("*.dll #1", "*.dll\" #1", "*.dll\",#1")) NOT CommandLine="*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*"
